ted; after any later mutation it is stale. Submit only when you choose to finish. The trajectory permits at most 4 model calls. Action catalog: [{\"action\":\"tree\",\"description\":\"List files below one workspace-relative path.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"search\",\"description\":\"Find literal UTF-8 text below one workspace-relative path.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"query\":{\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"query\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"read\",\"description\":\"Read one complete UTF-8 workspace file.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"patch\",\"description\":\"Replace one exact string in one mutable file. The old text must occur exactly once and the expected hash must be current.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"expected_file_sha256\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"new\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"type\":\"string\"},\"old\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"old\",\"new\",\"expected_file_sha256\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"replace_file\",\"description\":\"Replace one complete mutable UTF-8 file using its current file hash.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"content\":{\"maxLength\":32768,\"type\":\"string\"},\"expected_file_sha256\":{\"pattern\":\"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"path\":{\"maxLength\":512,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"content\",\"expected_file_sha256\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"run_check\",\"description\":\"Run one declared visible check against the exact current candidate.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"check_id\":{\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"check_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"description\":\"Reopen one exact externally custodied result by its receipt ID.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"result_id\":{\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"result_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"submit\",\"description\":\"Submit the exact current candidate and a bounded final response.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"final_response\":{\"maxLength\":12000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"final_response\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"atlas_root\",\"description\":\"Return the frozen atlas root.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{},\"required\":[],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"atlas_expand\",\"description\":\"Expand one atlas hierarchy node with deterministic pagination.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"cursor\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"node_id\":{\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"node_id\",\"cursor\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"atlas_search\",\"description\":\"Search frozen atlas metadata, headings, and literal source lines.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"cursor\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"query\":{\"maxLength\":200,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"query\",\"cursor\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},{\"action\":\"atlas_read\",\"description\":\"Read one exact atlas document or bounded section.\",\"parameters\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"node_id\":{\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"node_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}]<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nAUTHORITATIVE TASK\n# Task: write the Q3 XL large-world runtime evidence memo\n\nCreate a decision-support memo at `Q3XL_LARGE_WORLD_RUNTIME_MEMO.md` for the\nnext phase of this project.\n\nThe exact evidence universe is the frozen external atlas disclosed in the\ncurrent work surface. It contains completed experiment result reports, direct\ntranscript audits, and semantic reviews from this repository at one exact Git\ncommit. The corpus is intentionally too large to place in active context.\n\nUse the mechanical hierarchy, literal search, and exact reads to determine:\n\n1. which Q3 XL capabilities are supported under the tested conditions;\n2. which failures or variable behaviors recur across information selection,\n   semantic/detail preservation, construction, effect/check uptake, and\n   closure;\n3. which runtime substrate properties have direct evidence behind them;\n4. which proposed mechanisms remain optional, negative, inconclusive, or\n   parked;\n5. what important package, fixture, measurement, and causal limits constrain\n   the conclusions; and\n6. the smallest worthwhile next authentic large-world test.\n\nRequired artifact structure:\n\n- `# Q3 XL large-world runtime evidence memo`\n- `## Executive decision`\n- `## Supported capabilities`\n- `## Observed boundaries and recurring errors`\n- `## Runtime implications`\n- `## Optional or parked mechanisms`\n- `## Limits and counterexamples`\n- `## Recommended next authentic test`\n- `## Evidence index`\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Distinguish model/package observations from general model claims.\n- Distinguish information availability, selection, sufficiency judgment,\n  acquisition stopping, construction, effect, verification, and closure.\n- Preserve important negative and mixed results rather than telling a simple\n  progress story.\n- Do not call a mechanism supported merely because it reduced reads, tokens,\n  or overflow.\n- Treat model-authored plans, summaries, action bases, and hypotheses as\n  attributed artifacts rather than authoritative world state.\n- Use repository-relative Markdown links to exact evidence documents.\n- Include at least 12 evidence links spanning at least 8 experiment\n  directories.\n- State quantitative results only when the exact source supports them.\n- Do not claim that the atlas, current-object projection, memory, a controller,\n  a commit gate, semantic digests, or any other runtime component is promoted.\n- Keep the memo between 1,400 and 2,400 words, excluding the Evidence index.\n\nThe visible check validates artifact identity, required structure, link shape,\nand word-count bounds. It does not decide whether the memo is semantically\naccurate or whether its evidence is sufficient.\n\nWork until the memo is accurate and useful, check it, and submit it. Do not\nmodify another file.\n\n\nINITIAL EXACT WORK SURFACE\n{\"atlas_orientation\":{\"atlas_sha256\":\"ff262d7ab56e9213ea57917a2d44b2d544b1f03a37bfe550f4dd310347861ea9\",\"document_count\":103,\"node_id\":\"ROOT\",\"root_id\":\"ROOT\",\"section_count\":971,\"source_commit\":\"355df1826dc2f7cafd9db6122261cab4565ee356\",\"study_count\":77,\"total_exact_bytes\":766502},\"candidate_id\":\"db26870536cde28d4a602ed713ea10259eddcda4c28b17d9a25c44aa4ce1608e\",\"cell_id\":\"D1\",\"exact_external_history\":true,\"exact_results_reopenable_after_demotion\":true,\"mutable_paths\":[\"Q3XL_LARGE_WORLD_RUNTIME_MEMO.md\"],\"schema_version\":\"capability-terrain-initial-surface-v0\",\"visible_check_id\":\"memo_visible\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
